<article class="value-proposition__card" style="--value-proposition-bullet-color: #874451; --value-proposition-link-color: #874451;">
    <div class="value-proposition__card-copy">
            <div class="value-proposition__card-title">
<h2>Regulatory compliance at speed</h2></div>

            <div class="value-proposition__card-text">
                
When a new regulation lands, know exactly which agreements are affected &ndash; without manual review.
            </div>

        <div class="value-proposition__points">
            
<ul>
<li>Surface agreements impacted by SEC Marketing Rule or AIFMD disclosure requirements.</li>
<li>Track compliance posture across US and EU jurisdictions with continuous, clause-level obligation monitoring.</li>
<li>Generate audit-ready UCITS fund obligation reports in hours, not weeks.</li>
</ul>
        </div>

    </div>

