<article class="value-proposition__card" style="--value-proposition-bullet-color: #874451; --value-proposition-link-color: #874451;">
    <div class="value-proposition__card-copy">
            <div class="value-proposition__card-title">
<h2>Fee and revenue recovery</h2></div>

            <div class="value-proposition__card-text">
                
Stop losing revenue to unenforced fee structures, missed rebates, and buried entitlement terms.
            </div>

        <div class="value-proposition__points">
            
<ul>
<li>Surface fee terms, side letter provisions, and investor-specific conditions across every agreement.</li>
<li>Validate pricing, performance thresholds, and economic terms are being honored &ndash; and flag when they are not.</li>
<li>Connect fee intelligence to finance workflows so nothing slips through from negotiation to billing.</li>
</ul>
        </div>

    </div>

